error BYN1022: `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative

  4 │     unless n > 1 && n < 5 {
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a compound condition
    │
  help: use `if` with the negated condition
    │ 4 │     if !(n > 1 && n < 5) {
    │   │     ++++++++++++++++++++

error BYN1023: `unless x is null` is not allowed; write `if x is not null`

  7 │     unless name is null {
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a negated null test
    │
  help: use `if` with `is not null`
    │ 7 │     if name is not null {
    │   │     ++++++++++++++

error BYN1033: `unless` takes no likelihood word; write `if unlikely !…` or drop `unlikely`

  10 │     unless unlikely n > 3 {
     │            ^^^^^^^^ a likelihood word
     │
  help: remove the word, or write `if unlikely` with the negated condition
     │ 10 │     unless unlikely n > 3 {
     │    │            ---------

error BYN1022: `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative

  13 │     print("one") unless n > 1 || n < 0
     │                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a compound condition
     │
  help: use `if` with the negated condition
     │ 13 │     print("one") if !(n > 1 || n < 0)
     │    │                  ++++++++++++++++++++
